      "problem": "Let $c=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $d=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$ Find the vector projection of $c$ onto $d.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c=⟨$\n\n{{field-1}},\n\n{{field-2}},\n\n{{field-3}}\n\n$⟩$",
